#### **Pattern 1: Config Loading - Graceful Fallback**

Location: `/src/cli/commands/run.rs` (lines 112-119)

```rust
let config = match load_merged_config(&self.project_root) {
    Ok(c) => c,
    Err(BivvyError::ConfigNotFound { .. }) => {
        ui.error("No configuration found. Run 'bivvy init' first.");
        return Ok(CommandResult::failure(2));  // Exit code 2 = not found
