### 5. ERROR FLOW ACROSS MODULE BOUNDARIES

```
CLI (main.rs)
  └─> CommandDispatcher::dispatch()
        └─> Command::execute()  [impl for each command]
              │
              ├─> RunCommand::execute()
              │     ├─> load_merged_config()  → Result<BivvyConfig>
              │     ├─> resolve_steps()       → Result<HashMap<String, ResolvedStep>>
              │     ├─> StateStore::load()    → Result<StateStore>
              │     └─> WorkflowRunner::run_with_ui()  → Result<WorkflowResult>
              │
              ├─> InitCommand::execute()
              │     ├─> DetectionRunner::run()
              │     └─> fs operations        → Result<()>
