// /src/shell/command.rs
let output = cmd.output().map_err(|_| BivvyError::CommandFailed { ... })?;
```

**Rule**: `?` operator used wherever the error type matches the function's return type

---

### 9. TESTING PATTERNS

All error variants are tested in `/src/error.rs`:

```rust
